The bwplot function is part of Trellis graphics.  To put multiple Trellis
plots on the same page, refer to the section "Arranging Several Graphs on
One Page" in Chapter 6 of the Programmer's Manual.  The call par(mfcol=...)
does not work for Trellis functions.

The other alternative is to use boxplot intead of bwplot.

Andy

